.TH L10N-LINT 1 "February 2026" "l10n-lint 1.14.9" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
l10n-lint \- linter for localization files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-lint
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIPATH\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B l10n-lint
checks gettext .po and Qt .ts localization files for common issues.
Supports local files, directories, URLs, and GitHub repositories.
.SH CHECKS
.SS Core
missing-translation, fuzzy, placeholder-mismatch, duplicate
.SS Typography
inconsistent-punctuation, inconsistent-capitalization, trailing-whitespace,
double-spaces, mixed-quotes
.SS Technical
html-tag-mismatch, escaped-chars-mismatch, keyboard-shortcut-missing,
nordic-accelerator, numeric-mismatch
.SS Quality
untranslated-words, repeated-words, source-equals-translation, suspicious-length
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version number and exit.
.TP
.BR \-G ", " \-\-gtk
Launch the GTK graphical interface. Can optionally be followed by file paths.
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-github " " \fIREPO\fR
Lint a GitHub repository (owner/repo or URL).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: text (default), json, github
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Show only summary line.
.TP
.BR \-\-check
Exit code only, no output (for CI).
.TP
.BR \-\-skip\-fuzzy
Ignore fuzzy warnings.
.TP
.BR \-\-strict
Treat warnings as errors.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B l10n-lint ./translations/
Lint all .po and .ts files in the translations directory.
.TP
.B l10n-lint https://example.com/locale/sv.po
Lint a file from a URL.
.TP
.B l10n-lint \-\-github owner/repo
Lint all localization files in a GitHub repository.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No issues found.
.TP
.B 1
Issues found or error occurred.
.SH AUTHOR
Daniel Nylander <daniel@danielnylander.se>
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tp-lint (1),
.BR po-translate (1)
